==History==
2017
*The Goblin Gang [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 24/2/2017.
*On 16/3/2017, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(16/3/2017)|maintenance break]], increased the Spear Goblins' projectile speed to 500 (from 350). This was done to fix some unexpected behaviour that the Spear Goblins showed.
*On 12/6/2017, the [[Version History#June 2017 Update (12/6/2017)|June 2017 Update]], decreased the number of [[Spear Goblins]] spawned to 2 (from 3). It also increased the distance between the Goblins upon deployment. This changed the description to match the number of [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] spawned.
*On 9/10/2017, the [[Version History#Epic Quests Update (9/10/2017)|Epic Quests Update]], decreased the Spear Goblins' attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.3 seconds).
*On 12/12/2017, the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]], decreased the [[Goblins]]’ damage by 6%.
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], decreased the Spear Goblins' attack time interval to 1.2 seconds (from 1.1 seconds).
*On 4/6/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/6/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Spear Goblins’ damage by 34%, but also increased their attack time interval to 1.7 seconds (from 1.2 seconds) and increased their first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.2 seconds).
*On 2/7/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblins' hitpoints by 1%. This was to fix an inconsistency with [[Minions]] that could not take out Goblins in two hits at the same Level.
2019
*On 4/3/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2019)|Balance Update]], gave the Goblin Gang a new 0.15 seconds deploy stagger from each other.
2020
*On 2/6/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the deploy stagger for each Goblin to 0.1 seconds (from 0.15 seconds).
*On 31/8/2020, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20II%20Update%20(31/8/2020)|Clan Wars II Update]], added a card render to the Goblin Gang's card info screen.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 4/10/2022, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/10/2022)|Balance Update]], increased the number of Spear Goblins spawned to 3 (from 2). This also changed the description to match the number of troops spawned.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], increased the Goblins' first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.2 seconds).
2023
*On 4/4/2023, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/4/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the Spear Goblins' range to 5.5 tiles (from 5 tiles).
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], decreased the Spear Goblins’ first attack time interval to 0.3 seconds (from 0.5 seconds). It also added the Goblin Gang to the Goblin class.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Spear Goblins’ first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.3 seconds).
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], made it so that Goblin Gang's spawn formation would be correctly mirrored depending on which side of the [[Arenas|Arena]] it was placed.
*On 9/4/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/4/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblins' first attack time interval to 0.6 seconds (from 0.4 seconds).
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Spear Goblins’ first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.4 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, and decreased their range to 5 tiles (from 5.5 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}.

