==Trivia==
*Goblins are small, grotesque, monstrous creatures that appear in the folklore of multiple European cultures. First attested in stories from the Middle Ages, they are ascribed conflicting abilities, temperaments, and appearances depending on the story and country of origin, ranging from mischievous household spirits to malicious, bestial thieves. They often have magical abilities similar to a fairy or demon, such as the ability to shapeshift. Similar creatures include [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Duende duendes], [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kobold kobolds], [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leprechaun leprechauns], and [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghoul ghouls].
**In the German and Dutch language setting of the game, the Goblin Gang's name translates to "Kobold Gang". In the Spanish, Arabic, Persian, and Vietnamese language setting of the game, the Goblin Gang's name translates to "Duende Gang", "Ghoul Gang", "Goblin Group" and "Leprechaun Gang" respectively.
**The Goblin Gang is 1 of 17 [[cards]] associated with [[Goblins]], with the others being [[Spear Goblins]], [[Baby Goblins]], [[Dart Goblin]], [[Goblin Demolisher]], [[Suspicious Bush]], [[Goblin Cage]], [[Goblin Hut]], [[Goblin Giant]], [[Goblin Barrel]], [[Goblin Curse]], [[Goblin Drill]], [[Goblin Machine]], [[Party Rocket]], [[Party Hut]], [[Goblinstein]], and of course, Goblins.
*The Goblin Gang is 1 of 4 cards associated with outlawry, with the others being [[Rascals]], [[Bandit]], and the [[Boss Bandit]].
*It is 1 of 4 cards that spawns different [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] at once, the others being Rascals, [[Wizard Trio]], and the Goblinstein.
*The Goblin Gang is 1 of 10 cards to have an alliterative name, the others being the [[Royal Recruits]], [[Mega Minion]], Goblin Giant, [[Cannon Cart]], [[Barbarian Barrel]], [[Ram Rider]], [[Dagger Duchess]], Boss Bandit, and the [[Mighty Miner]].
*Even though the Goblin Gang spawns 6 Goblins, the card render displays 5 Goblins, due to the fact that the card used to spawn 5 troops. 
*Their [[Star Points|Star Level 3 Skin]] grants them a red mohawk similar to the Level 6 Goblin in Clash of Clans.
*The Goblin Gang was featured in the winning [[Battle Decks|deck]] of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/psZXKWHkKkE?si=PbjvbZt8stghz6eJ King's Cup II Tournament], by a player called Surgical Goblin.
*On 3/1/2024, the Goblin Gang was supposed to receive a Goblin first attack time interval increase to 0.5 seconds (from 0.4 seconds), but this change [https://royaleapi.com/blog/season-55-balance-wip was pulled back last minute].

